    "created_at": "2015-10-02T06:51:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-02T06:51:04Z",
    "body": "It seems to me that nobody wants to be the first to exactly copy another browser's UA string without adding itself at the end, so I suppose the spec would be ignored if we were to require it. So the string will likely continue to grow over time. :-(\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
